    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26">

                <pb facs="0141" n="29" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg29"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 715.1715/47</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jefferson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-17T15:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 17, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Nicaraguan Minister for Foreign Affairs informed me that he received a message
                    from Nicaraguan Minister to Honduras stating that Honduras is sending to Danli
                    500 soldiers with machine guns and cannon, and requested urgent instructions.
                    Nicaraguan Government informed its Minister not to discuss further the boundary
                    question nor to give offense, but to quietly proceed to Salvador.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
